Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.70,0:08:26.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}[西班牙语]满意 他是问我们此次的拜访吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Está satisfecho de que nos pregunte sobre nuestra visita?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.33,0:10:29.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}[西班牙语]殿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Su Alteza.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.82,0:10:35.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}能将您迎至我父王宫中 实属荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Es un honor darle la bienvenida al Palacio de mi padre.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.36,0:10:40.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}作为罗马帝国的将军 您的威名家喻户晓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Como general del imperio romano, su nombre es bien conocido.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.18,0:10:43.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}您会说西班牙语 玛丽小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Habla español, Srta. Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.68,0:10:46.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}略知一二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Un poco de conocimiento.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.35,0:10:49.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}有其母必有其女 不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Una madre debe tener una hija, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.75,0:21:34.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}(法国 布洛涅)
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.25,0:39:41.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}[西班牙语]我不饿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No tengo hambre.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.38,0:01:20.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}各位大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lords,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.29,0:01:24.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们现继续商讨伐法大策\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we will now proceed with our plans for an invasion of France.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.94,0:01:28.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从拿下战略重镇布洛涅开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will start by the capture of the strategic town of Boulogne.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.25,0:01:33.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人 若你仍心怀壮志 体格强健 能驰骋疆场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Grace, I shall appoint you commander of our armies,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.77,0:01:36.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我即命你为我军指挥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if you have the will and the stomach for the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.78,0:01:39.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 在下能获此等殊荣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty, I can only thank God
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.42,0:01:41.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再度征战沙场 荣耀加身 唯有感谢上苍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for the chance to win honour and glory in the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.92,0:01:43.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}手握利剑削铁如泥 冲锋呐喊震聋发聩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for what man would not prefer to die
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.37,0:01:45.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}又有何人不愿血洒疆场以死誓忠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with a sword in his hand and a cry in his throat...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.52,0:01:46.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.27,0:01:47.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而非于英格兰软卧香塌浑浑噩噩了此残生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}...rather than abed in England.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.94,0:01:51.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 正是 - 同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Aye. - Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.39,0:01:54.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诸位大人 我必须告知你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lords, I must tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.87,0:01:57.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗马皇帝特使 奈赫拉公爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that a special envoy from the court of the Emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.30,0:02:01.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将对我们进行非正式访问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the Duke of Najera, will pay us an unofficial visit,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.11,0:02:03.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}庆祝我们结盟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in honour of our alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:07.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此公爵是罗马皇帝最战绩灼灼的将军之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Duke is one of the Emperor's most successful generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.68,0:02:10.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他将先在此处受到萨里伯爵的接见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He should be first received here by the Earl of Surrey
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.28,0:02:12.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后再引至宫廷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and then brought to court.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.83,0:02:16.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我确信各位大人将以礼相待 令其宾至如归\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sure your lordships will welcome him as he deserves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.09,0:02:17.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.93,0:02:21.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已立誓痛击法王迫其投降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have vowed to bring King Francis into submission,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.13,0:02:24.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我将倾力而战兑现誓言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I will fulfil this promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.66,0:02:27.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我此生以德服人荣光无上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have been all my life a prince of virtue and honour,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.49,0:02:29.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诸位皆可作证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as you can all attest,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.67,0:02:33.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我永不食言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I have never contravened my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.72,0:02:37.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}虽然如今我年老力衰难以为继\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm too old to begin now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.61,0:02:42.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我 凯瑟琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I, Catherine
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.87,0:02:47.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请你 亨利 做我的丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}take thee, Henry, to be my wedded husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.56,0:02:52.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从今日往后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to have and to hold from this day forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.77,0:02:57.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不论顺境或是逆境 富裕或是贫穷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for better, for worse, for richer, for poorer,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.72,0:03:00.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}健康或是疾病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in sickness and in health,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.35,0:03:05.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们都风雨同舟 患难与共 同甘共苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to be bonaire and buxom in bed and at board,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.78,0:03:08.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}相濡以沫 永不分离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}till death us do part,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.20,0:03:13.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我愿与你结为连理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and thereto I plight thee my troth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.68,0:03:17.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拿戒指来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.22,0:03:27.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在天的主为我们见证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Benedicat, hic anulum, dominus, qui fecit caelum et terram.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.97,0:03:38.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以此枚戒指为证 你我结为连理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With this ring, I thee wed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.07,0:03:40.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只要我息尚存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With my body,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.76,0:03:42.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我将永远爱护珍惜你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thee worship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.75,0:03:50.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以圣父圣子圣灵的名义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In nomine Patris, et Filii, et Spiritus Sancti.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.65,0:03:53.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我宣布你们结为夫妻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I now pronounce thee man and wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.70,0:04:35.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 赫尔贝女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you, Lady Herbert.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.35,0:04:37.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下慢用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.81,0:04:43.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.99,0:04:47.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下慢用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.75,0:04:57.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 我有一言 不知当讲否\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty, if I may?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.30,0:05:00.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.72,0:05:06.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我决意成为几位孩子的慈爱继母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am determined to be a loving stepmother to your children.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.31,0:05:09.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然 我与玛丽女士已相识多年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course, I have known the Lady Mary for years,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.33,0:05:12.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能与爱德华王子和伊丽莎白女士成为朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but it would now be my pleasure rather than
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.35,0:05:15.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}相对职责而言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}my duty to make friends with the Prince Edward
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.25,0:05:17.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我更愿意欣然接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the Princess Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.08,0:05:20.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}若得陛下首肯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So with Your Majesty's permission
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.98,0:05:23.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想今后多邀他们进宫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would like to invite them more often to court,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.98,0:05:26.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这不仅是我出于私心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}not only for my sake
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.10,0:05:29.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也是为了让他们能经常见到父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but so they might more often see their father.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.15,0:05:33.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have my permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.18,0:05:37.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.30,0:05:43.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许陛下也会同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And perhaps Your Majesty might also agree
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.20,0:05:44.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让伊丽莎白女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to the Lady Elizabeth having
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.62,0:05:48.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拥有一处固定住所 如同玛丽女士一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}permanent lodgings at court, like the Lady Mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.74,0:05:54.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许吧 但我不愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps. But I would not
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.01,0:05:56.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我儿爱德华常常出入宫廷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}like my son Edward to come to court too often,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.78,0:05:59.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以防他被传染疾病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for fear he may catch infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.96,0:06:07.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我为你准备了些礼物 随后便会送到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have arranged for some gifts to be delivered to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.52,0:06:10.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}希望你会喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hope you like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.33,0:06:13.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多谢陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.67,0:06:19.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不必客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.06,0:06:28.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}公爵大人 试试这把\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Try this one, Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.49,0:06:35.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 公爵大人 - 诸位大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Your Grace. - My Lords.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.12,0:06:40.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很荣幸向诸位传达陛下的旨意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am pleased to convey to you His Majesty's commissions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.13,0:06:42.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯大人 您将从布鲁塞尔被召回\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Thomas, you are recalled from Brussels
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.47,0:06:45.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}荣任海军上将一职\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and are to be appointed Admiral of the Fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.47,0:06:47.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至于萨里大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lord Surrey, the King has seen fit
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.55,0:06:49.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下将封你为陆军上将\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to make you Marshal of the Field,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.04,0:06:51.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这可是至高无上的荣誉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a singular honour.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.40,0:06:55.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 谢大人 - 我等何时起航\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Your Grace. - When do we sail?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.12,0:06:57.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只待陛下一声令下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As soon as the King commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.79,0:06:59.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Thomas...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.01,0:07:05.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听说令兄赫福特大人反对战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}...is it true that your brother Lord Hertford,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.00,0:07:08.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 可有此事 - 确有此事 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- is against this war? - It is true, Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.35,0:07:10.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他担心陛下龙体欠安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He worries for the King's health,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.55,0:07:11.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并且心病成疾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in body and in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.60,0:07:16.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}若陛下崩于法兰西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He fears that if His Majesty should die in France,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.00,0:07:19.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只怕我国将陷入混乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he would leave the kingdom in great confusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.10,0:07:21.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下进来可好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How is the King?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.98,0:07:25.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}传言说他龙体欠佳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are rumours that he is unwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.27,0:07:27.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}甚至无法再继续领兵带队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That he may be unable to lead the army.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.40,0:07:29.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 大人 陛下定会亲自挂帅出征\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh no, my Lord. The King will lead his soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.76,0:07:31.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毋需质疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make no mistake of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.73,0:07:33.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事实是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For here is the truth:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.51,0:07:37.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下不仅希望收复法兰西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The King does not just want France back,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.08,0:07:41.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还想重拾他的青春与荣耀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but all of his honour and his youth as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.89,0:07:47.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我敢这般断言 只因我也有同样的渴望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And, in that, he is like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.48,0:08:05.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 请允许我向您引见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty, may I present
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.83,0:08:09.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}唐璜·埃斯塔班·曼里克·德拉尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Highness Don Juan Estaban Manrique de Lara,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.24,0:08:11.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}奈赫拉公爵殿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Duke of Najera.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.34,0:08:17.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 殿下 - 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Your Highness. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.56,0:08:20.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}欢迎来我宫中一聚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am very happy to receive you at my court.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.16,0:08:23.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}相信到目前为止 您对一切都还满意吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I trust you have been well entertained so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.50,0:08:30.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常满意 我游览了著名的塔楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Indeed. I have visited the famous Tower
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.90,0:08:32.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以及泰晤士河\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and also the River Thames.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.99,0:08:34.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在我眼中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In my opinion, it is not possible
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.42,0:08:37.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此河之美 举世无双\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that a more beautiful river should exist in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.01,0:08:42.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 而且河中还有许多… - 天鹅 殿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- And with so many... cisnes? - Swans, your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.07,0:08:44.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错 天鹅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes. Swans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.58,0:08:50.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}萨里大人还带殿下参观了巴黎园林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lord Surrey also took His Highness to the Paris Gardens,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.17,0:08:52.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看到了狗熊与狗打架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to see bears fighting with dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.93,0:08:54.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And then, in the same place,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.43,0:08:57.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们牵出了一匹小马 背上有只滑稽的猿猴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}they brought a pony with an ape on his back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.10,0:08:59.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只见那小马在狗群中乱踢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And to see the animal kicking among the dogs,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.20,0:09:03.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而猿猴还在它背上尖叫 着实令人捧腹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with the screams of the ape was very laughable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.37,0:09:05.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}公爵殿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, Your Highness, I trust
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.95,0:09:08.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}相信今晚 我貌美如花的娇妻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}this evening you will also be well entertained
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.79,0:09:10.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}及我的长女 玛丽女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by my beautiful wife the Queen
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.78,0:09:14.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也会让您满意而归\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and my first daughter, the Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.90,0:09:26.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}殿下只想确认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Highness only desires Your Majesty to confirm
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.01,0:09:29.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}贵国军队是否已准备好入侵法兰西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if your armies are ready for the invasion of France.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.27,0:09:31.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经做出了承诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have already given my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.21,0:09:35.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}殿下还想要我怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What more does Your Highness expect of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.20,0:09:56.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}奈赫拉公爵殿下驾到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Highness, the Duke of Najera.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.33,0:10:19.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 殿下 - 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Your Highness. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.35,0:10:22.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这位是玛丽女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.22,0:11:13.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这只是巧合吗 正说到战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, is it a coincidence that there is talk of war
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.20,0:11:17.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}奈赫拉将军就来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and then General Najera turns up here at court?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.13,0:11:18.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}绝对是巧合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.43,0:11:21.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这只是次私人访问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is a private visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.32,0:11:25.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}殿下是来伦敦观光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Highness came to London to see the Tower
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.11,0:11:26.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}游塔泛舟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and row on the river
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.76,0:11:28.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}观赏天鹅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and see the swans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.64,0:11:31.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你当我是白痴吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you take me for a fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.38,0:11:33.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不敢 大使阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, Excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.77,0:11:39.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}白痴与否 只有咱们自己最清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are what you are. And so am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.11,0:11:45.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凯特 我不跳舞行吗 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kat! May I not dance? Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.14,0:11:46.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你当然能行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.09,0:11:48.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你一定能跳好 小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course you can dance, my Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.14,0:12:08.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莱斯利先生 敢问 关于王后的信仰问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Risley, may I ask: what have you heard of
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.95,0:12:10.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您可有耳闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the Queen's religious beliefs?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.98,0:12:13.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然是与陛下一致的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are the same, surely, as His Majesty's?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.74,0:12:17.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我着实不敢苟同 我怀疑王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think not. Indeed, I suspect Her Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.15,0:12:21.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是秘密的新教徒 总有一天我会证明这点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of being a secret Protestant and I intend one day to prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.45,0:12:26.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您为此不惜冒险激怒陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And in so doing risk the anger of the King?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.79,0:12:30.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莱斯利先生 为了我们的信仰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Risley, for the sake of our faith,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.76,0:12:32.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以及我国的未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the future of our country
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.60,0:12:36.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已做好以身犯险的准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am prepared to risk a great deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.18,0:12:54.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布兹医生 怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dr. Butts! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.48,0:12:55.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}回王后 是陛下的腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's the King's leg, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.86,0:12:58.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的溃疡发作 现在极度痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His ulcer has burst. He is in great pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.02,0:12:59.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.02,0:13:07.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 凯瑟琳 - 亲爱的 让我看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Catherine! - Dearest, let me see!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.28,0:13:09.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 别看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.07,0:13:21.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还不算最糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have seen worse things.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.40,0:13:24.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给我片膏药 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give me a poultice. Quickly now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.76,0:13:27.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下可否稍稍抬腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If Your Majesty could move your leg...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.05,0:13:29.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}放在我的腿上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and place it across my lap?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.65,0:13:37.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好了 亲爱的 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There, dearest. Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.65,0:13:46.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只要陛下病体未愈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As long as the King is sick,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.81,0:13:49.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就要一直与他同室而居\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will move my bed to his chamber,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.68,0:13:53.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 以便及时照料 - 遵命 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- the better to look after him. - Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.68,0:14:04.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on, lads.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.84,0:14:07.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我曾上过战场 都是老黄历了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I went to war once, a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.76,0:14:09.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们和法国人拼长矛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We broke lances against the French.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.79,0:14:11.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}古时候的骑士们都那样打仗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The knights did in the old days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.51,0:14:14.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 可是这次 - 拿稳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- This... - Steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.51,0:14:17.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这次的战争不同 是枪炮作战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}...this is a different war: a war of guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.51,0:14:22.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 射得好 - 再来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Good shot. - Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.14,0:14:40.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 射得好 - 有两下子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Good shooting. - Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.53,0:14:42.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 你叫什么名字 - 理查 公爵大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What's your name? - Richard, Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.55,0:14:46.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 理查·雷兰 - 理查·雷兰 你即将奔赴战场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Richard Leland. - You are soon to war, Richard Leland.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.52,0:14:49.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}下一位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.83,0:14:54.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}理查 干得好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That was well done, Richard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.46,0:14:56.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我叫哈里 哈里·赫斯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Harry. Harry Hurst.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.46,0:14:59.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 你要去法国吗 - 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Are you coming to France? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.33,0:15:02.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 我枪打得不好 - 那你会什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I can't shoot like that. - What can you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.06,0:15:05.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是农场工人 我会养牛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm a farm labourer, me. I can herd cows,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.78,0:15:07.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}铲粪 修篱笆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}shovel shit, and build fences.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.63,0:15:11.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天啊 希望我能有一半的天才 哈里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Christ! I wish I'd half your talent, Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.81,0:15:14.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 谢谢 - 你 下一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Thank you. - You there! Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.59,0:15:17.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.96,0:15:19.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}爱德华王子殿下驾到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Prince Edward is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.52,0:15:31.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.70,0:15:35.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}殿下 真高兴见到您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Grace. How lovely to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.87,0:15:40.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后 我特来致谢 感谢您送来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madam, I came to thank you for the outfits of crimson velvet
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.49,0:15:43.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红色天鹅绒和白缎子的衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and white satin you sent me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.09,0:15:46.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能喜欢 我很高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, I am very glad that you liked them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.62,0:15:50.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还要感谢我高贵杰出的父王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would also like to thank my noble and illustrious father
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.49,0:15:56.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}赐予我的珠宝 但听说父王病了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for the jewels he sent me. But they told me he was sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.31,0:15:58.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}殿下请放心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, I am pleased to tell Your Grace
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.27,0:16:01.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下现在好多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that His Majesty is now much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.92,0:16:09.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他一定是爱我的 不然的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He must love me. For if he did not love me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.83,0:16:13.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就不会赐予我诸多赏赐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he would not give me these fine gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.68,0:16:19.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他非常爱你 你对他来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He loves you very much. You are very special
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.14,0:16:21.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常特别 我知道 如果有可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to him and I know that he would like
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.82,0:16:24.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他愿意经常去看你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to see you more often if he could.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.73,0:16:27.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.01,0:16:31.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}祝您日安 王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wish you a good day, Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.34,0:16:43.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可怜的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Poor child.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.91,0:16:47.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诸位大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lords.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.93,0:16:52.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}准备得如何 我认为今日有些懈怠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How go our preparations? I think they have gone slackly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.27,0:16:53.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我忍不住怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm beginning to suppose
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.91,0:16:56.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}众位是否对战争态度消极\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}your lordships are not so keen to go to war after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.31,0:16:58.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请坐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.93,0:17:03.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 炮架 推车 马车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty, the gun carriages, carts, wagons,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.62,0:17:05.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}烤箱 马匹 炮兵以及武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the ovens, horses, artillery, and
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.75,0:17:08.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都准备就绪 已经装船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}ordnance are all made ready and dispatched for shipping.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.35,0:17:10.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}另将征调300艘船供陛下所用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And a further 300 ships have been requisitioned
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.66,0:17:13.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将于一月之内到港\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for Your Majesty's use and will be in port within the month.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.26,0:17:14.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还要等一个月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Within the month!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.97,0:17:17.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}若非你怠慢渎职 此刻船早该备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They should be already in port if you had not been so remiss
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.94,0:17:19.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只待启程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and neglectful in your duties!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.87,0:17:21.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}公爵 布洛涅的地图准备好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Grace, what about our maps of Boulogne?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.84,0:17:25.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 我们没有地图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty, we do not have any maps,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.91,0:17:30.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以我们只能依靠法国间谍徳布伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so we will have to rely on the advice of a French spy, de Buren.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.42,0:17:32.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么说 我们对战场一无所知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So we are to blunder about in the dark
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.90,0:17:35.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只能依靠法国间谍的丁点忠诚吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and trust to the honesty of French spies!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.09,0:17:37.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}公爵 愿上帝保佑我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}God help us, Your Grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.76,0:17:39.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你巴不得我们战死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for it seems you have not!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.36,0:17:45.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别等什么船了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will not wait for more ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.53,0:17:49.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大军十日内乘船进军法国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This army will embark for France in 10 days time,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.30,0:17:52.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在加莱登陆 直接开进布洛涅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}land in Calais, and straight away march to Boulogne.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.45,0:17:57.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}攻打巴黎前 我们要用三周拿下此城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have three weeks to take this town before we proceed on to Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.60,0:18:03.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我出征法国之时 由王后陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, while I am in France, the Queen's Highness,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.10,0:18:05.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳王后摄政\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Queen Catherine, will act as Regent
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.29,0:18:07.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}全权处理一切事宜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and rule in my stead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.85,0:18:10.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}赫福德大人 我怀疑您反对这场战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lord Hertford, who I begin to suspect is against this war,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.72,0:18:13.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仍为陆军中尉 留守国都\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will stay as Lieutenant to the Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.33,0:18:15.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如今 我要提醒各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, need I remind your lordships that
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.97,0:18:19.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此去法国征战 不仅是为了荣誉和骄傲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we go to France not solely for honour and glory,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.39,0:18:22.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而是为了捍卫我们的公正权利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but to recover our just rights and inheritances
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.20,0:18:27.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和从我们手中强行夺走并强占已久的遗产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}taken from us by violence and withheld from us for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.49,0:18:29.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 陛下所言甚是 - 陛下圣明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Yes, Your Majesty. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.04,0:18:37.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.22,0:18:52.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他让王后摄政\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has made the Queen Regent!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.15,0:18:57.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 为何 她对治国毫无经验 - 我也不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Why? She has no knowledge of matters of state! - I do not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.66,0:19:00.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但据我所知 事实并非如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But from what I hear of her, I do not think it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.05,0:19:03.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想国王应该明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think the King should be aware
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.54,0:19:05.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}养虎为患一事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}how perilous a matter it is
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.41,0:19:08.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不容疏忽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to cherish a serpent in one's own bosom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.55,0:19:20.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳 以防我在法国遭遇不测\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Catherine, I have to tell you here in order,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.63,0:19:23.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要在此对你下口谕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in case do not come back from France.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.23,0:19:29.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}简言之 议会会通过新的继承法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shortly, Parliament will pass a new Act of Succession,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.76,0:19:33.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将我的儿子爱德华任命为继承人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}naming my son Edward as my heir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.58,0:19:35.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}若他发生意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If he has no issue,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.13,0:19:38.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}则由玛丽女士继承\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then it passes to the Lady Mary
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.87,0:19:41.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其后为伊丽莎白女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and then to the Lady Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.19,0:19:43.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是我的心愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Those are my wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.63,0:19:46.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.95,0:19:56.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛丽 别哭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not cry, Mary,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.23,0:19:58.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我又不是去死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for I do not intend to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.05,0:20:13.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你保证要经常给我写信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Promise you will write to me often!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.11,0:20:16.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我国内发生的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me all that happens in my kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.81,0:20:19.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}写下任何你想说的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and whatever you see fit to write.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.13,0:20:37.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我把孩子们托付给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I leave my children in your care,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.70,0:20:41.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你一定要照顾好他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}knowing that there are not more loving hands in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.25,0:20:48.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.73,0:21:39.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}重获新生的感觉很好吧 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It makes you happy to be alive, doesn't it, Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.91,0:21:51.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 公爵 - 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Your Grace. - Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.91,0:21:53.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}幸会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well met!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.65,0:21:56.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}情况如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How do we prosper?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.50,0:21:58.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 关口已经被阻闭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty, the port is blockaded
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.50,0:22:00.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}整个城镇也被基本包围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the town is already partially invested.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.55,0:22:04.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}守城官兵自城内紧锁城门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Its gates are shut and its defenders shut inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.11,0:22:06.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听说法国人自以为固若金汤的堡垒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have been told the French consider that their strong ramparts
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.25,0:22:10.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和双层防御城墙可轻易抵挡我们的火炮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and double walls make them invulnerable to our artillery!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.18,0:22:12.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那让我们走着瞧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, we shall see about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.91,0:22:15.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们这次带来的火炮足以荡平幽冥地府\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have brought enough cannon here to conquer hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.31,0:22:20.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 驾 - 前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Yeah! - Forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.44,0:22:54.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我几乎不敢相信自己的眼睛 看 理查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't believe my eyes! Look, Richard!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.30,0:22:57.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}英格兰国王 御驾亲临\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's the King of England himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.66,0:23:00.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 你有何感想 - 我要是法国人的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What do you think? - I reckon if I were the French
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.47,0:23:02.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在肯定被吓得屁滚尿流了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'd be fucking scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.98,0:23:07.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}英格兰的勇士们 今天 你们将会被载入史册\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Englishmen, today you have every reason to be proud!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.94,0:23:11.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今天 我们吹响了布洛涅战役的号角\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Today, we begin our campaign of Boulogne.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.21,0:23:15.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 威武 - 我们曾苦心孤诣 劝以良言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Yeah! - We have offered terms of peace
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.36,0:23:18.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只为保有我们的正当权益 夺回我们的遗产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in return for our just rights and inheritances.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.69,0:23:22.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 正当权益 - 无奈敌人利欲熏心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Just rights! - But our enemy has refused
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.70,0:23:25.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}悍然拒绝归还\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to render what they owe us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.10,0:23:28.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们可知道 勇敢的英格兰人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They should know that we do not
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.01,0:23:31.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从不缺乏为求正义而拼死抗战的决心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}lack the courage to fight to the death for justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.37,0:23:37.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这片曾被敌人铁骑践踏过的土地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These lands were taken from us by violence
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.05,0:23:40.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 今日要插满我们的旌旗 - 遍插旌旗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- and I mean to have them back. - We'll take them back!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.69,0:23:46.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为扬吾王威 为英格兰 为圣乔治 奋战到底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For King Henry, for England, and for St. George!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.26,0:23:52.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吾王万岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Long live the King!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.48,0:23:54.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为英格兰而战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For England!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.11,0:24:02.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要射击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ne tirez pas encore!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.31,0:24:05.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}躲在城墙后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Reculez derriere les murs!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.38,0:24:07.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}准备火炮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Prepare your fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.32,0:24:12.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}士兵 各就各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Solders, to your stations!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.27,0:24:16.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第一队指挥官 列阵以待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Section One Commander! Prepare your guns!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.87,0:24:20.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第一队 列阵以待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Section One, prepare your guns!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.16,0:24:28.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第二队指挥官 列阵以待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Section Two Commander! Prepare your guns!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.33,0:24:30.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}火炮装弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Load your cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.21,0:24:37.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 列阵以待 - 准备完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Prepare your guns! - Ready, guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.44,0:24:40.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第三队指挥官 列阵以待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Section Three Commander! Prepare your guns!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.85,0:24:48.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 火药桶 - 士兵 进入战壕 - 快步行进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Ram barrel! - Soldiers, into the trenches! - Quick march!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.42,0:24:52.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第二队指挥官 带上你的士兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Section Two Commander, take both your men!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.39,0:25:10.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 第三队指挥官 准备好了报告 - 遵命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Section Three Commander, report when ready. - Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.21,0:25:13.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 第三队准备完毕 - 准备完毕 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Section Three ready. - That's ready, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.84,0:25:17.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所有火炮枪支对准城堡和城门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All guns take aim for the gates and castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.50,0:25:19.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第一队 瞄准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Section One, take aim!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.47,0:25:21.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 各指挥官 - 瞄准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Section Commanders! - Take aim!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.26,0:25:23.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再次确认目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Confirm you have your target!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.14,0:25:28.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 第三队 瞄准 - 第一队 确认目标完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Section Three, take aim. - Section One, target ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.59,0:25:31.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第二队 确认目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Section Two, confirm target.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.60,0:25:37.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 第二队 准备完毕 - 第二队确认目标 瞄准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Section Two, ready! - Section Two has target, sir. Take aim!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.32,0:25:41.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 第三队 确认目标 - 第三队确认完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Section Three, confirm. - Section Three ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.44,0:25:45.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}保持队形 听我命令再开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hold sections! Hold fire until I give the order!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.48,0:25:47.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}列队 士兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's go, men.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.82,0:25:53.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 准备开火 列队 - 准备开火 - 列队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Hold fire! Move! - Hold your fire! - Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.69,0:26:00.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 准备开火 - 相时而动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Hold your fire! - Easy for the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.04,0:26:06.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 看看它到底有多坚固 - 各就各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Now we'll see how invulnerable it really is! - In position!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.46,0:26:09.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}准备完毕 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ready, captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.99,0:26:38.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第一队 开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Section one, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.53,0:26:46.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 扬吾王威 - 准备 - 准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- For the King! - Ready! - Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.68,0:26:58.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}全体注意 开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All sections, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.10,0:27:00.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第一队 开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Section One, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.21,0:27:04.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}开火 开火 开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}fire!fire!fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.62,0:27:36.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.10,0:27:47.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}装弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Charge the gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.04,0:27:54.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 英格兰 - 万岁 - 英格兰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- England! - England! - England!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.08,0:27:59.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为英格兰而战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For England!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.48,0:28:09.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}回撤原位 装填弹药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Back into position! Reload all guns!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.84,0:28:15.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如你见到赫福德大人 把这个交给他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you could see that this is delivered to my Lord Hertford.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.89,0:28:18.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 多谢 - 遵命 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Thank you. - Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.85,0:28:27.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 拉蒂默先生来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madam, here is Mr. Latimer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.91,0:28:30.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你好 阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.15,0:28:35.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 我已不能再使用那个头衔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alas, Madam, I am no longer entitled to such an address.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.97,0:28:39.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我被加德纳大主教剥去了主教之职\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was deprived of my bishopric by Bishop Gardiner.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.14,0:28:43.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道 同时我也了解当前的境况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know. And I know the circumstances of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.33,0:28:49.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我仍有意聘用你为我这里的私人牧师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Still, I have a mind to appoint you chaplain to my household.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.23,0:28:52.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此话当真吗 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you absolutely sure, my Lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.48,0:28:54.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您一定清楚我当下的身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must know my reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.72,0:28:58.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拉蒂默先生 你是一名神职人员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your reputation, Mr. Latimer, is of a man of the Gospels
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.65,0:29:01.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也是虔诚的基督徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and a true Christian.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.55,0:29:05.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}举例来说吧 你会否觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For example, do you suppose that it is a bad thing
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.96,0:29:07.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果全英格兰的子民都去研读圣经\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that everyone in England should be able to
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.73,0:29:10.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将会是一件坏事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}read the Bible for themselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.37,0:29:13.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 恰恰相反\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. On the contrary,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.01,0:29:15.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信那会是非常重要的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I believe it to be a vital thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.26,0:29:18.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有了上帝的指引 我们将变得无知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For without God's direct word we that be unlettered
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.29,0:29:21.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}困惑并且黯淡无光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}remain confused and without grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.47,0:29:23.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即便一些人鼓吹研读圣经\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even though some would say
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.57,0:29:27.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会导致异端邪说也不能动摇你吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that the reading of the Bible leads to heresy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.40,0:29:29.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}倘若真有人这么说 他们便是在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If they say so, then they are
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.57,0:29:32.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用人类的罪恶之心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}wickedly charging the holy sanctified word of God
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.97,0:29:34.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}挑战上帝神圣的权柄与教化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with the offences of man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.55,0:29:38.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错 人们怎会因见他人饱食无度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are right. Do people deny themselves food,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.78,0:29:40.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}便要自己忍饥废食\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}because they see others overeat?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.81,0:29:42.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}又怎会因见邻屋毁于火难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or avoid using fire because
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.21,0:29:44.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}便要自家弃柴避火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}they have seen a neighbour's house burn down?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.83,0:29:47.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多么愚昧无知 拉蒂默先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh blind ignorance, Mr. Latimer,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.18,0:29:50.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用人类的罪忖 诽谤上帝的神圣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to slander God for man's offences.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.07,0:29:55.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 如果您仍有意聘用我的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madam, if you are still of a mind to have me,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.61,0:29:59.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在下当全力以赴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will most joyfully be your chaplain.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.83,0:30:03.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.75,0:30:07.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有一事相求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have one favour,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.10,0:30:09.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你一定要对玛丽女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which is that you conceal the true workings
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.41,0:30:11.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}隐瞒你于此所传播的真正教义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of your mind from the Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.69,0:30:13.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在此世间没有任何事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For nothing in this world will
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.49,0:30:16.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能改变她对其母信仰的笃忠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}change her allegiance to the faith of her mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.50,0:30:18.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我亦对此十分尊重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I respect her for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.83,0:30:21.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 承蒙您信任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madam, believe me,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.16,0:30:23.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我与陛下的子女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall be the soul of discretion in my dealings with
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.92,0:30:25.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以及宫中人士打交道时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}all His Majesty's children,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.96,0:30:27.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}定会过从谨慎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and with the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.79,0:30:29.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.82,0:30:35.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.32,0:30:43.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}姐姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.51,0:30:49.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您确信拉蒂默先生真的可靠吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}are you sure you can really trust Mr. Latimer's discretion?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.61,0:30:54.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有句话不知当将不当讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know I should not say so to Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.58,0:30:57.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我恐他出尔反尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I fear his appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.19,0:30:59.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此刻我怎能畏首畏尾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Should I play the coward?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.18,0:31:05.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安 你也知道嫁给国王绝非我愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anne, you know that I never wanted to marry the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.06,0:31:08.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但既已如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But since I had to,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.07,0:31:11.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我理应在其位谋其政\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I may at least use what influence I now possess
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.25,0:31:14.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为我心仪之信仰谋福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to further the cause that I believe in with all my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.69,0:31:17.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}宗教改革势在必行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The cause of the Reformation!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.46,0:31:19.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样才能肃清异端\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then at least I can address my God
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.22,0:31:24.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}虔心追随我主荣光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with a clear conscience and an honest soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.58,0:31:27.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安 你一定要支持我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please say that you understand, Anne!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.77,0:31:30.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.03,0:31:39.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快速前进 左 右\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forward! Come on! Left, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.26,0:31:42.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}保持队型\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.79,0:31:52.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 见鬼 - 不会一直下下去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Shit! - It can't last forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.56,0:31:55.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}兄弟们 这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lads, come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.00,0:32:04.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 快 - 大家快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Come on! - Move on, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.28,0:32:11.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人 这边请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This way, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.88,0:32:19.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 陛下 特雷维索先生求见 - 吉洛拉摩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Your Majesty, Senor Treviso. - Girolamo.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.11,0:32:21.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.26,0:32:24.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过来 说说你们打算如何打通地道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come, show me where you intend to dig these mines.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.67,0:32:27.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}臣预计挖三条地道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I intend to dig three tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.90,0:32:30.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其中两个为明修栈道 暗度陈仓之用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Two will be a diversion, to confuse the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.63,0:32:32.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正在这里 城墙旁边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The main one will be here, at the town wall,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.63,0:32:34.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}地道直达城堡之下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which will lead directly under the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.56,0:32:36.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 用时多少 - 这要依情况而定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- How long will it take? - That depends on many things:
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.80,0:32:39.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}土质 溢水 诸如此类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The type of ground, danger of flooding, and so on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.14,0:32:42.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}敌方城墙的地基深度亦尤为重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Also, how far into the earth they have built the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.44,0:32:44.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但依臣之见 三周之内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I say we could be under the castle
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.38,0:32:47.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我方可将地道通至城堡 爆破城门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and able to detonate a huge explosion in three weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.34,0:32:50.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特雷维索先生 两周\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Two weeks, Senor Treviso!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.80,0:32:52.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给你两周\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Two weeks!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.50,0:32:54.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}人手任你调遣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take the troops you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.26,0:33:05.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大伙拼命点干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Put your backs into it, men.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.13,0:33:49.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我方进展神速\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are making excellent progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.94,0:33:51.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我想知道罗马皇帝方面战况如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I want to know how the Emperor is doing
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.66,0:33:53.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毕竟我们是联袂作战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}since we are in this war together.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.29,0:33:55.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}回陛下 罗马皇帝所率军队目前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty, the Emperor's forces are at present besieging
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.83,0:33:58.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正围攻卢森堡和圣埃蒂安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the fortresses of Luxembourg and St. Didier.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.49,0:34:00.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我方自有神助 定能早日破城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With God's help, we will break our siege first
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.55,0:34:01.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}进军巴黎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and then advance on Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.11,0:34:03.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我方强大火力已让敌方死伤惨重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With the damage our guns are already inflicting,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.79,0:34:06.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}臣保证拿下布洛涅已指日可待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I swear Boulogne will not hold out for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.92,0:34:08.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}依我看 法国人自以为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think that the French were foolish
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.25,0:34:10.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}城墙坚不可摧简直愚蠢之极\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to think that their walls were invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.50,0:34:12.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们还没见识过我们大炮的厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They had not seen our guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.91,0:34:27.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}轻点跟上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Avancez. Doucement.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.59,0:34:40.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}九月进攻巴黎 再好不过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Paris by September! Good,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.76,0:34:43.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}巴黎有不少我欲除之而后快的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}there are a lot of Frenchmen in Paris I would like to kill,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.70,0:34:46.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如此一来他们的如花美眷全都唯我是用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so I can sleep with their wives with a clear conscience!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.17,0:34:48.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}各位大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gentlemen
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.82,0:34:52.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 干 - 干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Salut! - Salut!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.84,0:34:55.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Majesty. - What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.61,0:34:58.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人 南城门外发现法国人踪迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The French! They've broken out beyond the southern gate, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.39,0:34:59.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我去看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll go!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.97,0:35:03.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人 我令你率大军封锁各个城门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Grace! I want you to cover all the gates with a massive force,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.00,0:35:06.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 以防调虎离山之计 - 遵旨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- in case this is a diversion. Go! - Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.46,0:35:20.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哪里去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.09,0:35:27.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我以国王之名命令你停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Arrêtez! Revenez au nom du roi!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.63,0:35:51.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那边 抓住他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There, there! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.62,0:35:54.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我奉国王之命令你束手就擒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stop in the name of the King!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.84,0:35:57.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Arrêtez!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.60,0:36:04.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 人呢 - 跑到沟下面了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Where is he? - He's down in the ditch!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.83,0:36:30.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大家小心为上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Keep your wits about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.13,0:36:36.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}掩护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.63,0:36:40.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}趴下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stay down!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.69,0:36:45.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 看见人了吗 - 两人已死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Do you see him? - Two on the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.57,0:37:06.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}冲啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A l'attaqué!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.46,0:37:10.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}准备 杀啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ready! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.73,0:37:21.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.81,0:37:26.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我虽无需帮助 但还是感谢您出手相救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I didn't need your help but thank you all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.20,0:37:30.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟上 誓死捍卫布洛涅 冲啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Suivez-moi! Pour Boulogne! A l'attaque!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.86,0:37:32.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些你来对付怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shall I leave them to you then?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.57,0:37:34.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}纳命来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah! Here we come!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.55,0:37:39.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为了英格兰 冲啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For England!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.16,0:38:42.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}父亲 父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Papa! Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.78,0:38:47.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}父亲 快醒醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Papa! Papa! Papa, roveille-toi!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.35,0:38:49.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快睁开眼啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Allez, ouvre tes yeux!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.72,0:39:05.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mademoiselle?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.76,0:39:23.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}装弹药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Load cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.87,0:39:30.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 将军 - 保持直线 挖这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- General. - Keep the lines straight. Dig in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.37,0:39:39.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我给你带了些吃的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've brought you some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.99,0:39:48.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你父亲还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your father is still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.34,0:39:54.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.52,0:39:56.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他虽身受重伤 但我们正在全力救治\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was wounded but we're taking care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.31,0:40:00.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 我能见他吗 - 很快 我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Can I see him? - Soon. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.60,0:40:03.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都给我卖力点 枪杆子都给我端起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Put your backs into it. Roll that barrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.76,0:40:07.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}敢问芳名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.99,0:40:11.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布丽吉特·罗塞洛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Brigitte, Brigitte Rousselot.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.99,0:40:13.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look lively.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.19,0:40:14.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吃点东西吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You should eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.40,0:40:19.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们为什么非要入侵我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why are you here? In France?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.05,0:40:23.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 这里不属于你们 - 但曾是我国领土\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- This isn't your country. - It used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.75,0:40:26.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们都曾祖居伊甸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And we all used to live in Eden.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.38,0:40:28.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}难道也要再夺回来不成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It doesn't mean we can go back again!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.70,0:40:32.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你为什么不放了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why won't you release me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.09,0:40:33.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那不就放虎归山了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So you can go on fighting against us?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.38,0:40:36.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错 这样我就能亲自手刃你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes! So I can go on killing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.40,0:40:37.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此言差矣 小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, Mademoiselle.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.93,0:40:39.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你现在可是我的阶下囚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're my prisoner now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.99,0:40:42.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或许我还能借你换一笔赎金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps I'll even get a ransom for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.46,0:40:48.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想问城里情况如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can I ask how things are in the town?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.15,0:40:50.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}城内粮草充足与否\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do people have enough food?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.58,0:40:53.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}守城足矣 大人无须担忧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They have plenty! You shouldn't worry about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.37,0:40:55.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}投降绝无可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They'll never surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.16,0:40:58.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尤其对你的国王 那个基督的怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not to that sacred monster, your King.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.48,0:40:59.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.49,0:41:01.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oui! Un monstre!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.89,0:41:07.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们称他是英国的尼禄(古罗马暴君)\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know we call him the English Nero!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.33,0:41:10.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没听说过吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Didn't you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.64,0:41:24.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}万福吾主 丧失信仰之人 必遭灾祸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dominus tecum. Benedicta tu in mulieribus,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.99,0:41:29.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吾主慈悲 泽被众生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}et benedictus fructus ventris tui.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.31,0:41:40.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 莱斯利先生 - 主教阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Mr. Risley. - Your Grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.30,0:41:48.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有些消息 也许您会感兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have some news I thought you might be interested in.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.05,0:41:50.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}据说凯瑟琳王后已经任命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It seems Queen Catherine has
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.52,0:41:54.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}休·拉蒂默为她的私人牧师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}appointed Hugh Latimer as her private Chaplain.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.43,0:41:56.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}消息是否属实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.47,0:41:58.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.83,0:42:03.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}居然还有人赞她冰雪聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I thought someone said she was an intelligent woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.86,0:42:13.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}地道进展如何 哈里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How's the tunnelling, Harry?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.09,0:42:16.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们已经掘了五十步长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We've dug about 50 paces.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.22,0:42:20.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真不是人干的活儿 全都是黏土\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's bloody hard work; and there's a lot of clay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.00,0:42:23.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}黏土还好 若是沙子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I prefer the clay. It's not like sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.40,0:42:26.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}随时都会流下来 活埋了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Always afraid it's gonna collapse and bury you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.52,0:42:29.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你那边怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How've you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.78,0:42:32.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有个法国军官时常露面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's a French officer comes out sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.59,0:42:35.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在城垛上逗留片刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He stands for a few moments on the castle rampart,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.67,0:42:39.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}观察我们 然后走回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}looking at us. Then he goes back inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.33,0:42:46.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 我只用开一枪 就能要他小命 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I just need one good shot. One good shot. - Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.67,0:42:51.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}喂 听说了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, have you heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.62,0:42:55.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}军帐附近来了几个女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are meant to be a few women around camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.20,0:43:00.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}倒是不多 只有几个 我听说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not many, mind. Just a few. That's what I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.12,0:43:02.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想得性病就去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you fancy the pox!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.14,0:43:07.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是啊 也许你说得对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Aye. Perhaps you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.03,0:43:14.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}话说回来 我老家有妻子 她有孕在身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In any case, I have a wife back home and she is with child.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.43,0:43:18.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你想要儿子还是女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh! What do you want a boy or girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.31,0:43:20.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.64,0:43:26.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}愿上帝保佑我们能快点回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hope to God we're not here too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.64,0:43:37.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下亲征 时日不长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Although Your Majesty's absence has not been long,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.12,0:43:38.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然臣妾日思夜想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}yet the want of your presence
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.82,0:43:42.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}寝食难安 茶饭不思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}means that I cannot take pleasure in anything
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.12,0:43:45.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}惟盼陛下鸿雁传书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}until I hear from Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.92,0:43:49.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}臣妾度日如年 所为牵肠挂肚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Time hangs heavily. I have a great desire to know
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.82,0:43:52.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}惟陛下之近况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}how Your Majesty has done since you left.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.35,0:43:54.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只求陛下平安无恙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For your prosperity and health
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.93,0:43:59.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}妾身如何当无关紧要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I prefer and desire more than my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.84,0:44:02.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}臣妾虽知陛下出宫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And although I know Your Majesty's absence
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.24,0:44:04.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}皆为操劳国家大事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is never without great need
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.82,0:44:10.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然人非草木 思君之情 难以自抑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}still, love and affection compel me to desire your presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.48,0:44:18.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下待臣妾之情深意重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thus love makes me set aside my own convenience and pleasure for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.10,0:44:21.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}纵千言万语不能言表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at whose hands I have received so much love
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.11,0:44:25.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}臣妾无以为报 惟全心侍奉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and goodness that words cannot express it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.31,0:44:36.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听闻天气恶劣 延误征程 陛下甚为忧心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We hear word of ill weather and delays besetting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.53,0:44:41.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然龙体安康 实乃大幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And though we thank God for your good health,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.41,0:44:44.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}臣妾恭候佳音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we anxiously await the joyous news
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.53,0:44:47.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}遥祝陛下此番大获全胜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of the success of your great venture
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.93,0:44:50.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}平安凯旋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and for your safe and triumphant return.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.95,0:44:52.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}下面多放些桶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}More buckets down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.20,0:44:56.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}举国上下日日祈祷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For which all England offers daily prayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.59,0:44:58.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里多放些支撑物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}More supports in the space!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.66,0:45:06.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下命臣妾代理朝纲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear I am but a poor substitute for Your Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.02,0:45:09.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只怕有心无力 难以胜任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the matter of the guidance of your kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.08,0:45:13.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}惟愿陛下早日回宫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I long for your return.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.56,0:45:24.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}愿神保佑陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I commit you to God's care and governance.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.75,0:45:28.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您卑微的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By Your Majesty's humble,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.83,0:45:35.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}妻子 仆人 凯瑟琳王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}obedient wife and servant, Catherine the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.84,0:47:13.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恳请陛下再宽限几日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But, Majesty, I beg you to give us a little more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.43,0:47:16.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}士兵们不眠不休 日夜赶工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The men are working all day and all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.44,0:47:19.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有时不得已停止挖掘 加固洞顶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But sometimes we must stop digging to support the roof
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.86,0:47:22.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}防止塌方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or else everything collapses.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.76,0:47:25.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}医官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Master Surgeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.67,0:47:30.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 请便 特雷维索先生 - 陛下 臣告退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Senor Treviso. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.42,0:47:36.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 何事 - 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What is it? - Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.50,0:47:41.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}近来有十名士兵丧命 臣深感遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I regret to inform you of the deaths of ten of your soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.15,0:47:44.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 无非因伤阵亡 - 非也 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Soldier die of their wounds. - No, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.21,0:47:48.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们均死于血痢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The men all died of the bloody flux.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.30,0:47:53.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 痢疾吗 - 是的 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Dysentery? - Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.91,0:47:56.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}臣担心此种疾病会在全军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am afraid that there is an outbreak of the disease
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.09,0:47:57.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}蔓延开来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}throughout your army.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.67,0:47:59.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天知道会死多少人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}God alone knows how many it will take away.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.47,0:48:09.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}退下 医官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Master Surgeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.59,0:48:15.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 特雷维索先生 - 恭送陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Mr. Treviso. - Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.38,0:48:21.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恭送陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.31,0:48:30.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有话要问你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let me ask you something:
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.86,0:48:33.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你如何看待那位意大利绅士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you think of our Italian gentleman,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.06,0:48:36.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吉洛拉摩·特雷维索先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Senor Girolamo Treviso?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.31,0:48:38.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}修地道那家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The builder of tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.09,0:48:42.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 此话何意 - 你相信他吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What do you mean? - I mean do you trust him?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.03,0:48:45.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为何不相信他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why should I not trust him?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.41,0:48:49.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是我偶然听闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's only that I happen to know that, some time ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.23,0:48:51.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他曾说会造一面足够大的镜子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he said he could build a mirror large enough
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.09,0:48:54.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将其置于多佛的崖壁上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that if set upon the cliffs of Dover
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.57,0:48:57.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下便能从中窥到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Majesty would be able to see,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.11,0:49:01.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在布洛涅港口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}reflected in it, the movement of French ships
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.66,0:49:04.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出入的法国船只\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in and out of the port of Boulogne.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.24,0:49:08.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阁下明白我的意思吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you see what I mean, Your Grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.82,0:49:11.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你觉得他疯了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you think he's mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.10,0:49:15.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阁下自有判断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's only a suggestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.79,0:49:19.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过 非他一人如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But then, he's not the only one!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.25,0:49:32.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}换岗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Change the watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.45,0:49:36.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夜巡换岗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Change the night watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.51,0:50:07.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 小组待命 - 拉我上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Section ready! - Pull me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.51,0:50:12.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}准备完毕 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ready captain!
